# Read by search tools (ripgrep, fd and agent search); Git and Cargo ignore this file.
# Hides raw historical run output from searches. Receipts and summaries (*.json, *.md)
# stay searchable, and every file remains tracked and linked from its evidence README.
docs/evidence/**/*.log
docs/evidence/**/*.stdout
docs/evidence/**/*.stderr
docs/evidence/**/*.rgba
docs/evidence/**/*.zlib
docs/evidence/**/*.tar.gz
docs/evidence/**/cli-*-*/
